  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shtip and Berovo Together for the  improvement of living conditions of  Roma communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action intends to resolve the following needs and constrains of the context and target groups: - In the areas where Roma informal houses are raised, there is the lack of drinkable water supply and stable and safe electricity provision. Unpaved streets, uncovered sewage system, public lightening; - Unemployment rate is estimated approx. 60%; - Severe health issues caused by poverty, bad nutrition, living in non-hygienic conditions and limited access to health care and social services are an urgent issue more for Stip (80% of Roma population dont join social-health services) than for Berovo (98% of population join social-health service);&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
